Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus-bin, gnome-shell, libgl1, libegl1, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxinerama1, libxi6, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0, libsecret-1-0
Description: GNOME lock-screen integration with direct Duo authentication
 ProxiLens provides a desktop settings application, a user-session
 wake agent, and a GNOME Shell extension for an explicit Duo unlock
 action on supported GNOME Wayland sessions.
 .
 The wake agent is installed as a systemd user service and is not
 enabled automatically. Each desktop user can enable it manually.
